# {{ .github_org }} Organization Project

## PR Guidelines

- All PRs target `main` on this repository
- Use descriptive PR titles (< 70 chars)
- Reference issue numbers in PR descriptions
- Run `pnpm check` before requesting review

## Build & Development

- Install: `pnpm install`
- Build: `pnpm build`
- Test: `pnpm test`
- Lint: `pnpm lint`
- Format: `pnpm format`
- All checks: `pnpm check`

## Code Style

- TypeScript, ESM modules, strict typing
- No `any` — use proper types
- Run the full check suite before committing
